WEBVTT

00:01:34.361 --> 00:01:36.461
♪ I'M GOING DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:38.363
♪ GONNA HAVE MYSELF
A TIME ♪

00:01:38.365 --> 00:01:39.831
♪ FRIENDLY FACES
EVERYWHERE ♪

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:41.700
♪ HUMBLE FOLKS
WITHOUT TEMPTATION ♪

00:01:41.702 --> 00:01:43.035
♪ GOING DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

00:01:43.037 --> 00:01:44.770
♪ GONNA LEAVE
MY WOE'S BEHIND ♪

00:01:44.772 --> 00:01:46.438
♪ AMPLE PARKING
DAY OR NIGHT ♪

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:48.240
♪ PEOPLE SPOUTING
"HOWDY NEIGHBOR" ♪

00:01:48.242 --> 00:01:49.574
♪ HEADED ON
UP TO SOUTH PARK ♪

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.877
♪ GONNA SEE IF
I CAN'T UNWIND ♪

00:01:51.879 --> 00:01:53.712
( mumbling )

00:01:54.381 --> 00:01:56.248
♪ SO COME ON DOWN
TO SOUTH PARK ♪

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.184
♪ AND MEET SOME
FRIENDS OF MINE ♪

00:01:58.219 --> 00:01:59.819
NOW YOU
BE CAREFUL ERIC.

00:01:59.821 --> 00:02:02.588
THE WOODS CAN BE
VERY DANGEROUS.

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:04.524
OKAY MOM.

00:02:05.026 --> 00:02:06.859
READY TO GO
HUNTING CARTMAN?

00:02:06.861 --> 00:02:09.329
MY UNCLE JIMBO SAYS WE GOTTA
GET UP THERE EARLY.

00:02:09.331 --> 00:02:10.630
RIGHT
UNCLE JIMBO?

00:02:10.632 --> 00:02:11.397
THAT'S RIGHT
STANLY.

00:02:11.399 --> 00:02:14.567
ANIMALS ARE MUCH EASIER
TO SHOOT IN THE MORNING.

00:02:14.569 --> 00:02:15.101
HERE HON,

00:02:15.103 --> 00:02:18.471
I PACKED YOU CHEESY POOFS
AND HAPPY TARTS.

00:02:18.473 --> 00:02:20.073
DON'T WORRY
MISS CARTMAN,

00:02:20.075 --> 00:02:21.174
WE'LL TAKE
GOOD CARE OF HIM.

00:02:21.176 --> 00:02:24.010
I BROUGHT MY OLD WAR BUDDY DAN
TO KEEP THINGS SAFE.

00:02:24.012 --> 00:02:27.714
( voice box )
HELLO MRS. CARTMAN,
HOW ARE YOU TODAY?

00:02:27.716 --> 00:02:29.882
BE SURE TO USE
LOTS OF BUG SPRAY,

00:02:29.884 --> 00:02:31.718
AND IF YOU HAVE
TO POO-POO

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:34.520
DON'T WIPE
WITH POISON IVY.

00:02:34.522 --> 00:02:35.588
( laughing )

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:36.656
DUDE,
THAT'S SICK MOM!

00:02:36.658 --> 00:02:39.726
I KNOW IT CAN GET SCARY
UP IN THOSE THOSE WOODS.

00:02:39.728 --> 00:02:41.661
BUT JUST REMEMBER,

00:02:41.663 --> 00:02:44.097
MOMMY'S NOT
FAR AWAY.

00:02:44.099 --> 00:02:45.331
( laughing )

00:02:45.333 --> 00:02:46.299
DRIVE, DRIVE!

00:02:46.301 --> 00:02:48.401
YOU GIVE YOUR
MOMMY A KISSY.

00:02:48.403 --> 00:02:51.104
DRIVE THE CAR, DAMMIT,
DRIVE!

00:02:51.973 --> 00:02:54.240
DON'T GET SCARED UP IN
THE MOUNTAINS, CARTMAN.

00:02:54.242 --> 00:02:56.309
SHUT UP, I'M NOT
SCARED OF NOTHING!

00:02:56.311 --> 00:02:59.712
MAYBE YOUR MOM CAN GIVE<i> ME</i>
A KISS TOO, CARTMAN.

00:02:59.714 --> 00:03:00.780
( mumbling )

00:03:00.782 --> 00:03:03.716
WHOA!
THAT'S DISGUSTING!

00:03:03.718 --> 00:03:05.985
YOU PIECE OF CRAP,
I'LL KILL YOU!

00:03:05.987 --> 00:03:07.520
THAT'S THE
SPIRIT BOYS!

00:03:07.522 --> 00:03:10.323
LET'S GET THAT
TESTOSTERONE FLOWING!

00:03:10.325 --> 00:03:11.524
NOW BOYS,

00:03:11.526 --> 00:03:13.593
I NEED TO GET SERIOUS
FOR A MINUTE.

00:03:13.595 --> 00:03:17.296
I WANT YOU TO UNDERSTAND
A FEW BASIC RULES OF HUNTING,

00:03:17.298 --> 00:03:18.698
SINCE THIS IS
YOUR FIRST TIME.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:21.134
FIRST OF ALL, DON'T EVER
WALK WITH YOUR GUN

00:03:21.136 --> 00:03:22.635
UNLESS THE
SAFETY IS ON.

00:03:22.637 --> 00:03:24.771
SECOND, DON'T SHOOT ANYTHING
THAT LOOKS HUMAN.

00:03:24.773 --> 00:03:27.840
AND THIRD, NEVER SPILL YOUR BEER
IN THE BULLET CHAMBER.

00:03:27.842 --> 00:03:30.610
( Stan )
UNCLE JIMBO,
WE DON'T DRINK BEER.

00:03:30.612 --> 00:03:31.210
YOU WHAT?!

00:03:31.212 --> 00:03:32.845
( voice box )
OH, YEAH,
THAT'S RIGHT.

00:03:32.847 --> 00:03:35.448
I DON'T THINK
8-YEAR-OLD KIDS DRINK BEER.

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:36.482
I LIKE
CHOCOLATE MILK!

00:03:36.484 --> 00:03:39.485
WE'LL BE DOING PLENTY
OF DRINKING ON<i> THIS</i> TRIP.

00:03:39.487 --> 00:03:42.655
AFTER ALL,
HUNTING SOBER IS LIKE...

00:03:42.657 --> 00:03:44.657
<i>FISHING...</i>
SOBER.

00:03:44.659 --> 00:03:48.494
IT SURE WILL BE NICE TO GET OUT
OF THE CITY FOR A WHILE.

00:03:48.496 --> 00:03:51.064
AWAY FROM
CIVILIZATION.

00:03:52.734 --> 00:03:55.902
WELL,
HERE WE ARE.

00:03:56.171 --> 00:03:59.138
OKAY, EACH OF YOU
YOUNG 'UN'S TAKE A GUN,

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:01.374
A BEER
AND SOME SMOKES.

00:04:01.376 --> 00:04:04.544
HEY, I DIDN'T
GET A GUN!

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:06.179
SWEET.

00:04:06.181 --> 00:04:07.947
THIS IS LIKE THE GUN
I USED IN 'NAM.

00:04:07.949 --> 00:04:09.382
YOU WEREN'T
IN VIETNAM CARTMAN.

00:04:09.384 --> 00:04:12.018
( voice box )
WERE YOU STATIONED
IN<i> DA NANG</i>?

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:13.586
CARTMAN ALWAYS
MAKES STUFF UP.

00:04:13.588 --> 00:04:14.954
YOU CAN'T BELIEVE
ANYTHING HE SAYS.

00:04:14.956 --> 00:04:16.856
HEY, I'LL BLOW
YOUR FREAKING HEAD OFF!

00:04:16.858 --> 00:04:19.158
LOOK OUT SON,
THAT'S DANGEROUS!

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.828
YOU'RE GONNA
SPILL YOUR BEER.

00:04:26.234 --> 00:04:27.934
MY UNCLE JIMBO SAYS
THAT AFTER THIS

00:04:27.936 --> 00:04:29.769
HE'S GONNA TAKE ME
HUNTING IN AFRICA.

00:04:29.771 --> 00:04:31.237
WOW,
THAT'LL BE COOL!

00:04:31.239 --> 00:04:34.707
MY MOM SAYS THERE'S A LOT OF
BLACK PEOPLE IN AFRICA.

00:04:34.709 --> 00:04:36.142
BOYS,
LOOKIE THERE.

00:04:36.144 --> 00:04:38.211
THAT THERE IS A
ROCKY MOUNTAIN BLACK BEAR.

00:04:38.213 --> 00:04:40.913
ONE OF THE FEW REMAINING
OF ITS KIND.

00:04:40.915 --> 00:04:42.682
ISN'T IT BEAUTIFUL?

00:04:42.684 --> 00:04:45.852
MY GOD, IT'S COMING
RIGHT FOR US!

00:04:46.955 --> 00:04:49.355
HEY, IT WASN'T
COMING RIGHT FOR US.

00:04:49.357 --> 00:04:51.324
IT WAS JUST
SITTING THERE.

00:04:51.326 --> 00:04:52.525
SHH,
NOT SO LOUD.

00:04:52.527 --> 00:04:54.760
THAT THERE IS JUST
A TECHNICALITY.

00:04:54.762 --> 00:04:55.528
WHAT DO
YOU MEAN?

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:58.331
YOU SEE, THE DEMOCRATS
HAVE PASSED A LOT OF LAWS

00:04:58.333 --> 00:05:00.066
TRYING TO STOP US
FROM HUNTING.

00:05:00.068 --> 00:05:01.234
DEMOCRATS
PISS ME OFF.

00:05:01.236 --> 00:05:03.469
THEY SAY WE CAN'T SHOOT
CERTAIN ANIMALS ANYMORE

00:05:03.471 --> 00:05:05.738
UNLESS THEY'RE POSING
AN IMMEDIATE THREAT.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.673
THEREFORE, BEFORE
WE SHOOT SOMETHING

00:05:07.675 --> 00:05:10.376
WE HAVE TO SAY
"IT'S COMING RIGHT FOR US".

00:05:10.378 --> 00:05:13.012
WOW, YOU'RE SMART
UNCLE JIMBO.

00:05:13.014 --> 00:05:14.547
JIMBO, LOOK.

00:05:14.549 --> 00:05:16.048
OH, IT'S A DEER.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:19.685
LOOKS LIKE ABOUT
A 46-GAUGE, NED.

00:05:19.921 --> 00:05:22.855
IT'S COMING
RIGHT FOR US!

00:05:26.094 --> 00:05:26.959
KICK ASS!

00:05:26.961 --> 00:05:28.394
DID YOU
SEE THAT?

00:05:28.396 --> 00:05:32.098
I WAS IMPALED BY THAT
FEROCIOUS CHARGING BUCK.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:35.568
RABBIT, RABBIT
FIVE O'CLOCK.

00:05:36.437 --> 00:05:38.337
LET'S MOVE!
MOVE!

00:05:38.339 --> 00:05:40.072
IS THIS HUNTING?

00:05:40.074 --> 00:05:40.840
I GUESS SO.

00:05:40.842 --> 00:05:44.177
DUDE, I'M STARTING
TO HAVE FLASHBACKS.

00:05:44.179 --> 00:05:44.544
WHAT?

00:05:44.546 --> 00:05:46.312
STAND FORTH,
PULL UP FLANK!

00:05:46.314 --> 00:05:49.515
LOOK OUT FOR CHARLIES
UP IN THE TREES!

00:05:52.086 --> 00:05:54.787
THIS ONE'S
YOURS STAN.

00:05:56.724 --> 00:05:58.591
IT'S COMING
RIGHT FOR US!

00:05:58.593 --> 00:06:01.227
IT'S COMING
RIGHT FOR US.

00:06:04.165 --> 00:06:05.464
SHOOT IT STAN.

00:06:05.466 --> 00:06:07.633
I GOT YOUR BACK
SOLDIER.

00:06:08.937 --> 00:06:09.769
I CAN'T.

00:06:09.771 --> 00:06:12.905
WHAT THE--
WHAT'S WRONG WITH YOU?

00:06:12.907 --> 00:06:14.707
I DON'T WANNA
SHOOT THE BUNNY.

00:06:14.709 --> 00:06:16.609
WHAT THE HELL ARE
YOU TALKING ABOUT

00:06:16.611 --> 00:06:18.945
YOU'RE BABBLING,
YOU'RE NOT MAKING ANY SENSE.

00:06:18.947 --> 00:06:19.979
YOU'RE HYSTERICAL!

00:06:19.981 --> 00:06:21.013
I'M NOT
HYSTERICAL,

00:06:21.015 --> 00:06:22.248
I JUST DON'T WANNA
SHOOT THE BUNNY.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.750
NO NEPHEW OF MINE IS
GONNA BE A TREE-HUGGER!

00:06:24.752 --> 00:06:25.418
YEAH, HIPPIE!

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:27.653
GO BACK TO WOODSTOCK
IF YOU CAN'T SHOOT ANYTHING.

00:06:27.655 --> 00:06:29.121
I CAN SHOOT<i> YOU,</i>
FAT ASS!

00:06:29.123 --> 00:06:30.656
I CAN
SHOOT YOU TOO!

00:06:30.658 --> 00:06:31.290
I'LL KILL YOU!

00:06:31.292 --> 00:06:33.359
I'LL FILL YOU
FULL OF LEAD!

00:06:33.361 --> 00:06:34.260
( rumbling )

00:06:34.262 --> 00:06:36.495
HEY WHAT'S THAT?

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.067
( humming )

00:06:44.339 --> 00:06:46.606
( rumbling sounds )

00:06:50.812 --> 00:06:53.946
WHAT THE HECK
IS THIS?

00:06:55.083 --> 00:06:57.216
YEAH FRANK?
IT'S RANDY.

00:06:57.218 --> 00:06:57.917
GOOD.

00:06:57.919 --> 00:07:01.220
YEAH, LISTEN,
THE LITTLE NEEDLE'S MOVING.

00:07:01.222 --> 00:07:04.123
IT'S GOING BACK AND FORTH
REALLY FAST.

00:07:04.125 --> 00:07:05.992
WHAT DOES
THAT MEAN?

00:07:05.994 --> 00:07:07.093
UH-HUH.

00:07:07.095 --> 00:07:08.160
UH-HUH.

00:07:08.162 --> 00:07:10.162
LET ME CHECK.

00:07:10.498 --> 00:07:12.431
YEAH,
IT'S SMOKING.

00:07:12.433 --> 00:07:13.266
UH-HUH.

00:07:13.268 --> 00:07:15.101
OH, REALLY?

00:07:15.103 --> 00:07:16.969
REALLY?

00:07:18.606 --> 00:07:19.772
OH, MY GOD!

00:07:19.774 --> 00:07:21.807
A VOLCANO!

00:07:21.809 --> 00:07:24.543
( suspenseful music )

00:07:25.346 --> 00:07:27.046
( sipping )

00:07:27.048 --> 00:07:28.581
EHHHH.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:33.886
MY WEENIES
WON'T COOK.

00:07:33.888 --> 00:07:35.454
THIS WOOD
WON'T BURN.

00:07:35.456 --> 00:07:39.892
LOOKS LIKE WE'LL HAVE TO USE
THE OLD INDIAN FIRE TRICK.

00:07:39.894 --> 00:07:42.128
YEAH.

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:50.670
( laughing )

00:07:50.972 --> 00:07:54.507
HEY STOP, DROP,
AND ROLL, NED!

00:07:56.544 --> 00:07:57.176
WHOA!
WHOA!

00:07:57.178 --> 00:07:58.878
GODDAMNIT,
I JUST GOT THAT VAN.

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:01.480
HOW THE HELL ARE WE
SUPPOSED TO GET HOME?

00:08:01.482 --> 00:08:04.150
OH, IT HURTS,
IT HURTS!

00:08:04.152 --> 00:08:05.318
HEY, YOU GUYS,

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:08.187
THIS ONE'S PRETTY
GOOD RIGHT NOW.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.189
BUT YOU SEE
MR. MAYOR,

00:08:10.191 --> 00:08:14.160
YOU CAN'T STOP SERVING SALISBURY
STEAK IN OUR PUBLIC SCHOOLS.

00:08:14.162 --> 00:08:16.262
WHAT'S NEXT,
MEAT LOAF?

00:08:16.264 --> 00:08:18.864
WE ARE QUITE AWARE
OF YOUR CONCERNS CHEF, BUT--

00:08:18.866 --> 00:08:21.267
( intercom )
Mayor, the geologist
is here to see you.

00:08:21.269 --> 00:08:23.102
MY GEOLOGIST...?
NOW?

00:08:23.104 --> 00:08:24.804
TELL HIM THE
INFECTION IS FINE

00:08:24.806 --> 00:08:26.706
AND I DON'T NEED
ANOTHER CHECK-UP.

00:08:26.708 --> 00:08:28.641
No Mayor, that's
a gynecologist,

00:08:28.643 --> 00:08:30.443
a geologist
studies the Earth.

00:08:30.445 --> 00:08:32.645
DON'T YOU THINK
I KNOW THAT?

00:08:32.647 --> 00:08:34.647
HOW DEAR YOU INSULT
MY INTELLECT!

00:08:34.649 --> 00:08:36.949
I WENT TO PRINCETON
FOR GODSAKE!

00:08:36.951 --> 00:08:38.484
YOU GET OUT
OF MY OFFICE!

00:08:38.486 --> 00:08:39.885
I'm not in
your office Mayor,

00:08:39.887 --> 00:08:42.555
I'm talking to you
through a speaker.

00:08:43.624 --> 00:08:46.125
JUST SEND IN
THE GEOMETRIST!

00:08:46.127 --> 00:08:46.826
Geologist.

00:08:46.828 --> 00:08:48.227
YOU ARE
FIRED, BUDDY!

00:08:48.229 --> 00:08:50.363
Thank you Mayor, it's been
great working for you.

00:08:50.365 --> 00:08:52.865
MAYOR, WE HAVE GOT
A VERY BIG PROBLEM.

00:08:52.867 --> 00:08:55.301
MT. EVANSON
IS ABOUT TO ERUPT.

00:08:55.303 --> 00:08:56.836
( suspense music )

00:08:56.838 --> 00:09:00.005
WHAT DOES THIS MEAN
TO THE TOWN?

00:09:00.007 --> 00:09:03.442
THIS GRAPH SHOWS EVERYTHING
FROM "NORMAL" TO "BAD".

00:09:03.444 --> 00:09:06.479
RIGHT NOW SOUTH PARK
IS<i> HERE.</i>

00:09:06.481 --> 00:09:08.614
( suspense music )

00:09:17.191 --> 00:09:19.158
MY GOD!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:21.260
MAYOR, SOME OF
THE SCHOOL CHILDREN

00:09:21.262 --> 00:09:24.830
ARE UP CAMPING ON THAT
MOUNTAIN RIGHT NOW!

00:09:24.832 --> 00:09:25.931
THIS<i> IS</i> BIG.

00:09:25.933 --> 00:09:27.700
JOHNSON, JOHNSON,
ARE YOU THERE?!

00:09:27.702 --> 00:09:29.969
( intercom )
You just fired Johnson,
Mayor.

00:09:29.971 --> 00:09:31.103
I'm his
replacement, Ted.

00:09:31.105 --> 00:09:33.205
TED, WE HAVE GOT
A MAJOR CRISIS HERE!

00:09:33.207 --> 00:09:36.275
I WANT YOU TO GET ON THE PHONE
AND CALL "INSIDE EDITION",

00:09:36.277 --> 00:09:39.245
"RESCUE 911"
AND "ENTERTAINMENT TONIGHT".

00:09:39.247 --> 00:09:41.414
YOU BETTER GET MY STYLIST
ON THE PHONE TOO.

00:09:41.416 --> 00:09:45.651
DON'T WORRY,
THINGS ARE UNDER CONTROL.

00:09:47.221 --> 00:09:50.022
AND THEN NED PICKED UP
THE GRENADE

00:09:50.024 --> 00:09:50.656
AND<i> BOOM</i>!

00:09:50.658 --> 00:09:52.191
BLASTED HIS
ARM CLEAR OFF!

00:09:52.193 --> 00:09:55.060
WE SPENT THREE HOURS LOOKING
FOR THAT DAMN ARM,

00:09:55.062 --> 00:09:56.362
BUT IT WAS
NEVER TO BE FOUND.

00:09:56.364 --> 00:10:00.232
SOME SAY IT'S STILL
CRAWLING AROUND TO THIS DAY.

00:10:01.002 --> 00:10:02.601
RAAHH...!

00:10:03.204 --> 00:10:04.103
GOTCHA!

00:10:04.105 --> 00:10:05.337
THAT'S NOT
SCARY.

00:10:05.339 --> 00:10:07.973
YOU WERE SCARED CARTMAN,
YOU ALMOST PEED YOUR PANTS.

00:10:07.975 --> 00:10:09.909
SHUT UP I DIDN'T
PEE MY PANTS!

00:10:09.911 --> 00:10:12.378
HEY NED,
HAND ME THAT GIN.

00:10:13.614 --> 00:10:15.881
YOU BOYS
WANNA TIE ONE ON?

00:10:15.883 --> 00:10:18.184
NO, THANKS, THAT STUFF
TASTES LIKE PEE.

00:10:18.186 --> 00:10:19.685
YEAH,
CARTMAN'S PEE.

00:10:19.687 --> 00:10:21.086
YOU<i> WOULD</i>
TASTE MY PEE!

00:10:21.088 --> 00:10:22.621
WHAT THE HELL'S
WRONG WITH YOU?

00:10:22.623 --> 00:10:25.224
CAN'T YOU HAVE
A LITTLE ALCOHOL?

00:10:26.027 --> 00:10:29.261
CHRIST, LOOK AT THAT
LITTLE BASTARD GO!

00:10:30.498 --> 00:10:31.664
YOU SEE THAT STAN?

00:10:31.666 --> 00:10:34.200
NOW<i> THAT</i> IS A DIRTY
LITTLE BASTARD.

00:10:34.202 --> 00:10:36.602
HEY, I'M A DIRTY
LITTLE BASTARD TOO.

00:10:36.604 --> 00:10:39.004
HEY YOU GUYS,
I KNOW A SCARY STORY.

00:10:39.006 --> 00:10:41.640
SHUT UP CARTMAN,
YOU CAN'T SCARE<i> ANYBODY.</i>

00:10:41.642 --> 00:10:42.374
OH YEAH?

00:10:42.376 --> 00:10:46.779
HAVE YOU GUYS EVER
HEARD OF<i> SKUZZLE-BUTT</i>?

00:10:46.781 --> 00:10:47.713
WHAT BUTT?

00:10:47.715 --> 00:10:49.482
SKUZZLE-BUTT
IS A CREATURE

00:10:49.484 --> 00:10:51.450
THAT LIVES UP
ON THIS VERY MOUNTAIN

00:10:51.452 --> 00:10:55.588
AND KILLS ANYBODY
WHO CLIMBS TO THE TOP.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:56.121
WHY?

00:10:56.123 --> 00:10:58.457
BECAUSE IT LOVES
THE TASTE OF BLOOD

00:10:58.459 --> 00:11:02.261
AND LIKES TO ADD PIECES
TO ITS DEFORMED BODY.

00:11:02.263 --> 00:11:03.696
DEFORMED HOW?

00:11:03.698 --> 00:11:05.898
WELL, ON HIS LEFT ARM,

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.133
INSTEAD OF A HAND,
HE HAS...

00:11:08.135 --> 00:11:09.235
A HOOK.

00:11:09.237 --> 00:11:09.869
A KNIFE.

00:11:09.871 --> 00:11:12.204
NO, A PIECE
OF CELERY.

00:11:12.206 --> 00:11:12.872
CELERY?

00:11:12.874 --> 00:11:14.840
YES, AND HE WALKS
WITH A LIMP

00:11:14.842 --> 00:11:17.109
BECAUSE ONE OF
HIS LEGS IS MISSING.

00:11:17.111 --> 00:11:19.211
AND WHERE HIS LEG
<i>SHOULD</i> BE

00:11:19.213 --> 00:11:22.348
THERE'S NOTHING BUT...
<i>PATRICK DUFFY.</i>

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:23.849
PATRICK DUFFY?

00:11:23.851 --> 00:11:26.085
DAMNIT CARTMAN,
THAT'S NOT SCARY?

00:11:26.087 --> 00:11:27.086
WHAT DO YOU MEAN?

00:11:27.088 --> 00:11:29.121
HAVE YOU EVER SEEN
"STEP BY STEP"?

00:11:29.123 --> 00:11:31.123
SO HE LIVES ALONE
ON THIS MOUNTAIN

00:11:31.125 --> 00:11:34.360
AND WEAVES BASKETS
AND OTHER ASSORTED CRAFTS.

00:11:34.362 --> 00:11:36.028
THEY SAY THAT
ON QUIET NIGHTS

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:38.898
YOU CAN HEAR HIM
WEAVING HIS BASKETS.

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:41.567
( weaving sounds )

00:11:41.836 --> 00:11:44.403
CARTMAN, YOU SUCK AT
TELLING SCARY STORIES!

00:11:44.405 --> 00:11:46.438
YEAH GIVE ME
THAT FLASHLIGHT.

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:48.007
( rumbling )

00:11:48.309 --> 00:11:49.341
WHAT IS THAT?

00:11:49.343 --> 00:11:52.645
MAYBE IT'S SKUZZLE-BUTT
COMING TO WEAVE US
INTO BASKETS.

00:11:52.647 --> 00:11:53.746
HEY,
IT MIGHT BE!

00:11:53.748 --> 00:11:57.449
GOSH, I HOPE HE DOESN'T CUT ME
WITH HIS CELERY HAND.

00:11:57.451 --> 00:11:59.051
SCREW YOU GUYS!

00:11:59.053 --> 00:12:00.586
GO TO HELL!

00:12:00.588 --> 00:12:03.989
NED, WHY DON'T YOU WHIP OUT
THE OLD CANCER KAZOO?

00:12:03.991 --> 00:12:06.292
LET'S DO
A LITTLE SONG.

00:12:06.627 --> 00:12:10.029
( voice box )
♪ COOMBAYA,
MY LORD ♪

00:12:10.031 --> 00:12:11.730
♪ COOMBAYA ♪

00:12:11.732 --> 00:12:15.301
♪ COOMBAYA,
MY LORD ♪

00:12:15.303 --> 00:12:17.503
♪ COOMBAYA ♪

00:12:17.939 --> 00:12:20.372
♪ COOMBAYA,
MY LORD ♪

00:12:20.374 --> 00:12:22.841
♪ COOMBAYA ♪

00:12:23.144 --> 00:12:27.179
♪ OH, LORD
COOMBAYA ♪

00:12:27.381 --> 00:12:29.582
♪ SOMEONE'S CRYING, LORD ♪

00:12:29.584 --> 00:12:30.482
♪ COOMBAYA ♪

00:12:30.484 --> 00:12:33.118
THEY DON'T THINK
SKUZZLE-BUTT IS SCARY, HUH?

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:34.553
LET'S SEE
HOW THEY LIKE IT

00:12:34.555 --> 00:12:36.689
WHEN THEY ACTUALLY
<i>SEE</i> SKUZZLE-BUTT.

00:12:36.691 --> 00:12:38.557
I'LL SCARE THE HELL
OUT OF 'EM TOMORROW.

00:12:38.559 --> 00:12:43.062
♪ SOMEONE'S CRYING LORD,
COOMBAYA ♪

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:47.066
♪ OH, LORD,
COOMBAYA ♪

00:12:50.237 --> 00:12:52.571
STAN, STAN,
WAKE UP!

00:12:52.573 --> 00:12:53.238
WHAT DUDE?

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.873
I DON'T KNOW
WHERE CARTMAN IS.

00:12:54.875 --> 00:12:56.442
I THINK SOMETHING
TOOK HIM AWAY.

00:12:56.444 --> 00:12:58.143
WHERE'S MY UNCLE JIMBO
AND NED?

00:12:58.145 --> 00:13:00.079
THEY'RE OUT FISHING
WITH KENNY.

00:13:00.081 --> 00:13:02.514
BUT THIS IS SUPPOSED TO BE
<i>MY</i> CAMPING TRIP.

00:13:02.516 --> 00:13:04.283
WHY DO THEY LIKE
KENNY SO MUCH?

00:13:04.285 --> 00:13:05.551
DOESN'T HE LIKE<i> ME</i>
ANYMORE?

00:13:05.553 --> 00:13:08.921
WELL STAN, YOU WANNA KNOW
WHAT I THINK?

00:13:08.923 --> 00:13:09.755
WHAT?

00:13:09.757 --> 00:13:11.056
( farting )

00:13:12.193 --> 00:13:14.159
WHAT A BEAUTIFUL MORNING
FOR FISHING.

00:13:14.161 --> 00:13:17.496
THERE'S ONE,
THERE'S A FISH RIGHT THERE!

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:21.734
GOT IT.

00:13:23.904 --> 00:13:25.471
GREAT INSTINCTS BOY.

00:13:25.473 --> 00:13:27.806
UNCLE JIMBO,
CARTMAN'S MISSING!

00:13:27.808 --> 00:13:30.042
WHO?
THE FAT KID?

00:13:30.044 --> 00:13:30.576
YEAH.

00:13:30.578 --> 00:13:33.078
I GUESS WE BETTER
GO LOOK FOR HIM.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.114
NED, WE GOTTA
CUT IT SHORT.

00:13:35.116 --> 00:13:37.449
FIRE UP THE 12-20!

00:13:40.488 --> 00:13:43.188
WELL I THINK
THAT'S ABOUT THE LIMIT

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:45.124
FOR<i> OUR</i>
FISHING PERMIT.

00:13:45.126 --> 00:13:48.527
IT SMELLS LIKE
DEAD FISH HERE.

00:13:48.529 --> 00:13:49.928
( mumbling )

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:52.231
OH, MAN,
THAT IS NASTY.

00:13:52.233 --> 00:13:54.199
I DON'T THINK
I'VE EVER SEEN

00:13:54.201 --> 00:13:56.735
A KID AS COOL
AS YOU KENNY.

00:13:56.737 --> 00:13:59.938
I'M MAKING YOU
MY HONORARY NEPHEW.

00:14:06.947 --> 00:14:09.348
BUT NOW A TICKING
TIME BOMB OF HOT LAVA

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:10.516
WAITS TO
ENGULF THESE PEOPLE

00:14:10.518 --> 00:14:13.419
AND END THEIR MISERABLE LIVES
WITH ONE LAST FLEETING MOMENT

00:14:13.421 --> 00:14:15.988
OF EXCRUCIATINGLY
PAINFUL BURNING AGONY.

00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:18.924
HEY, I'M ON TV!
I'M ON TV!

00:14:18.926 --> 00:14:21.860
MAYOR, WHAT YOU DOING
TO PREPARE FOR THIS

00:14:21.862 --> 00:14:23.662
INEVITABLE
CATASTROPHE?

00:14:23.664 --> 00:14:25.264
ALL WE KNOW
RIGHT NOW

00:14:25.266 --> 00:14:26.832
IS THAT SOME OF
OUR CHILDREN

00:14:26.834 --> 00:14:29.501
ARE CAMPING ON
<i>THAT</i> MOUNTAIN--

00:14:29.503 --> 00:14:31.603
I'M SORRY,
CAN I START OVER?

00:14:31.605 --> 00:14:32.337
HUH?

00:14:32.339 --> 00:14:34.039
YOU CAN
EDIT THIS, RIGHT?

00:14:34.041 --> 00:14:36.041
READY,
THREE, TWO, ONE.

00:14:36.043 --> 00:14:37.476
ALL WE KNOW
RIGHT NOW

00:14:37.478 --> 00:14:41.213
IS SOME OF OUR CHILDREN ARE
UP CAMPING ON THAT MOUNTAIN.

00:14:41.215 --> 00:14:44.683
WE CAN'T DO ANYTHING
UNTIL WE GET THEM!

00:14:44.685 --> 00:14:48.787
OKAY PEOPLE,
LET'S GO GET THOSE KIDS!

00:14:48.789 --> 00:14:52.691
C'MON EVERYBODY, YOU GOTTA
HELP THE CHILDREN.

00:14:54.962 --> 00:14:56.962
HE COULDN'T
HAVE GONE FAR...

00:14:56.964 --> 00:14:58.597
UNLESS SOMETHING
<i>DRUG</i> HIM OFF.

00:14:58.599 --> 00:15:01.467
THERE'S NOT MANY ANIMALS
OUT TODAY JIMBO.

00:15:01.469 --> 00:15:06.004
YEAH, IT'S ALMOST LIKE
SOMETHING FUNNY'S GOING ON.

00:15:06.006 --> 00:15:07.606
( rumbling )

00:15:07.708 --> 00:15:10.242
CHRIST NED, WHAT'D YOU
HAVE FOR BREAKFAST?

00:15:10.244 --> 00:15:13.245
I DON'T KNOW MAN,
I'VE GOT SOME BAD GAS.

00:15:13.247 --> 00:15:14.947
WAIT,
THERE'S A RAM!

00:15:14.949 --> 00:15:18.083
IT'S COMING
RIGHT FOR US!

00:15:18.085 --> 00:15:19.551
( gunshots )

00:15:20.321 --> 00:15:22.321
NICE SHOOTING,
KENNY.

00:15:22.323 --> 00:15:25.090
HERE, YOU NEED
A BIGGER GUN.

00:15:25.092 --> 00:15:25.557
LOOK!

00:15:25.559 --> 00:15:29.328
I AM SKUZZLE-BUTT,
LORD OF THE MOUNTAINS!

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:32.297
BEHOLD MY
PATRICK DUFFY LEG!

00:15:32.299 --> 00:15:33.499
WHAT IS IT?

00:15:33.501 --> 00:15:34.967
DUDE, IT'S
SKUZZLE-BUTT!

00:15:34.969 --> 00:15:36.235
CARTMAN
WASN'T LYING.

00:15:36.237 --> 00:15:37.002
HOLY CROW!

00:15:37.004 --> 00:15:38.737
WE CAN MAKE A MINT
KILLING THIS THING.

00:15:38.739 --> 00:15:41.473
WE'LL BE ON THE COVER
OF "GUNS AND AMMO".

00:15:41.475 --> 00:15:44.743
THIS CALLS
FOR SOME HJ-14.

00:15:44.812 --> 00:15:47.880
THOSE GUYS
ARE TOTALLY SCARED.

00:15:47.882 --> 00:15:50.783
FIRE IN THE HOLE!

00:15:50.785 --> 00:15:53.185
HOLY CRAP!

00:15:55.156 --> 00:15:56.822
DAMN, I THINK
I MISSED.

00:15:56.824 --> 00:15:59.525
WHAT THE HELL IS WRONG
WITH YOU PEOPLE?!

00:15:59.527 --> 00:16:01.927
C'MON, LET'S MOVE!
MOVE!

00:16:01.929 --> 00:16:03.529
WAIT, WAIT!

00:16:04.331 --> 00:16:05.697
IS IT ON?
OKAY.

00:16:05.699 --> 00:16:08.600
OKAY, PEOPLE, FORM GROUPS
AND SEARCH THE MOUNTAIN.

00:16:08.602 --> 00:16:11.670
REPORT BACK HERE EVERY HOUR,
YOU GOT THAT?

00:16:11.672 --> 00:16:13.839
MAYOR, I MIGHT
HAVE AN IDEA.

00:16:13.841 --> 00:16:14.807
OH, WHAT?

00:16:14.809 --> 00:16:17.042
IF WE CAN DIG
A VERY LARGE TRENCH

00:16:17.044 --> 00:16:19.378
WE CAN DIVERT THE LAVA
INTO A CANYON.

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:21.580
THEN IT WOULD
BYPASS SOUTH PARK

00:16:21.582 --> 00:16:23.081
PRETTY MUCH
COMPLETELY.

00:16:23.083 --> 00:16:25.417
AND... THAT WOULD
BE GOOD, RIGHT?

00:16:25.419 --> 00:16:26.518
I'M PRETTY SURE.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:28.520
WELL, WHAT ARE
WE WAITING FOR?

00:16:28.522 --> 00:16:30.622
OKAY, PEOPLE,
CHANGE OF PLANS.

00:16:30.624 --> 00:16:32.991
HALF OF YOU
GRAB SHOVELS.

00:16:32.993 --> 00:16:34.726
THESE LOOK LIKE
HIS TRACKS.

00:16:34.728 --> 00:16:36.028
HE MUST'VE
GONE THIS WAY.

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:37.896
NED, PREPARE
SOME HK-12.

00:16:37.898 --> 00:16:41.233
I'LL BET THAT SUCKER'S HEADED
FOR A HIGHER ELEVATION.

00:16:41.235 --> 00:16:43.402
THE HIGHER--
BIRD!

00:16:43.537 --> 00:16:46.638
THE HIGHER UP IT GOES
THE BETTER IT CAN BREATHE.

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:48.941
LOOK,
UP THERE!

00:16:48.943 --> 00:16:51.944
YOU GUYS,
IT'S JUST ME!

00:16:51.946 --> 00:16:53.846
ARE WE SURE
IT'S SKUZZLE-BUTT?

00:16:53.848 --> 00:16:56.081
DOES IT HAVE PATRICK DUFFY
FOR A LEG?

00:16:56.083 --> 00:16:57.749
I CAN'T TELL,
LET'S KILL IT!

00:16:57.751 --> 00:17:00.919
I GOTTA GET OUT OF THIS
STUPID COSTUME!

00:17:00.921 --> 00:17:02.688
KENNY,
YOU TAKE THE FRONT.

00:17:02.690 --> 00:17:04.623
NO, I CAN DO IT,
UNCLE JIMBO.

00:17:04.625 --> 00:17:05.824
I WANNA
BAG THAT ANIMAL.

00:17:05.826 --> 00:17:07.860
THAT'S THE SPIRIT, KIDDO!
LET'S HUNT!

00:17:07.862 --> 00:17:09.461
YOU GUYS, YOU GUYS,
I WAS JUST KIDDING!

00:17:09.463 --> 00:17:12.364
( reporter )
AS SOME PEOPLE OF SOUTH PARK
TRY DESPERATELY

00:17:12.366 --> 00:17:13.732
TO SAVE
THEIR MOUNTAIN TOWN,

00:17:13.734 --> 00:17:15.400
OTHERS LOOK FOR
THE MISSING TOWNSPEOPLE.

00:17:15.402 --> 00:17:18.971
BUT ALL MUST TAKE
EVERY PRECAUTION NECESSARY.

00:17:18.973 --> 00:17:20.572
OKAY, PEOPLE,
LISTEN UP.

00:17:20.574 --> 00:17:22.608
AS WE NEAR THE TOP
OF THE MOUNTAIN

00:17:22.610 --> 00:17:26.178
THE CHANCES OF OUR ENCOUNTERING
SOME LAVA BECOMES GREAT.

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:30.082
THEREFORE I HAVE SPECIAL
ORDERED THIS TRAINING FILM

00:17:30.084 --> 00:17:32.918
TO ASSIST US
IN VOLCANO SAFETY.

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:36.321
MR. GARRISON,
IF YOU WOULD PLEASE.

00:17:38.225 --> 00:17:39.658
Harborers of sorrow,

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.460
Natural disasters
can be the cause

00:17:41.462 --> 00:17:43.629
of troubling and
undesirable stress,

00:17:43.631 --> 00:17:45.497
and a volcano
is no exception.

00:17:45.499 --> 00:17:48.000
But what should you do
if a volcano erupts

00:17:48.002 --> 00:17:49.401
near you
or your family?

00:17:49.403 --> 00:17:52.571
Here we see the Stevens' family
enjoying a picnic,

00:17:52.573 --> 00:17:55.207
But suddenly daughter
hears a noise...

00:17:55.209 --> 00:17:56.408
It's a volcano.

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:59.111
Junior seems worried,
but have no fear Junior,

00:17:59.113 --> 00:18:01.046
Jane learned in school
what to do

00:18:01.048 --> 00:18:03.448
when you hear
a volcano erupt.

00:18:03.617 --> 00:18:06.985
That's right, Jane,
duck and cover.

00:18:07.855 --> 00:18:13.258
So what will you do when
you hear a volcano erupting?

00:18:13.761 --> 00:18:16.328
That's right,
duck and cover.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:19.131
Looks like
you got the idea.

00:18:19.967 --> 00:18:22.801
Thank you
and goodbye.

00:18:22.803 --> 00:18:25.837
OKAY,
ANY QUESTIONS?

00:18:25.839 --> 00:18:27.039
THAT HAS
GOT TO BE

00:18:27.041 --> 00:18:29.408
THE MOST RIDICULOUS
LOAD OF PIG CRAP

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:31.176
I HAVE<i> EVER</i> SEEN!

00:18:31.178 --> 00:18:32.878
THAT'S ENOUGH
OUT OF YOU!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.813
I'M GONNA BAG
SKUZZLE-BUTT,

00:18:34.815 --> 00:18:37.049
THEN WE'LL SEE
WHO'S A LITTLE BASTARD.

00:18:37.051 --> 00:18:40.485
( Cartman )
HEY SERIOUSLY,
YOU GUYS!

00:18:41.021 --> 00:18:43.188
KILL IT STAN,
KILL IT.

00:18:48.128 --> 00:18:50.329
C'MON, STAN,
KILL IT!

00:18:50.664 --> 00:18:52.564
GODDAMNIT,
I CAN'T DO IT!

00:18:52.566 --> 00:18:55.334
YOU PANSY,
GIVE ME THAT GUN!

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:56.802
CARTMAN?

00:18:56.804 --> 00:18:58.670
GODDAMNIT,
DON'T SHOOT ME!

00:18:58.672 --> 00:19:00.005
WHAT THE
SAM HELL?

00:19:00.007 --> 00:19:01.740
I WAS JUST TRYING
TO SCARE YOU GUYS.

00:19:01.742 --> 00:19:03.508
YOU CAN PUT
THE GUNS DOWN NOW!

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:06.211
SO MUCH FOR THE COVER
OF "GUNS AND AMMO".

00:19:06.213 --> 00:19:10.215
BUT I THINK WE'VE LEARNED
SOME IMPORTANT LESSONS.

00:19:10.217 --> 00:19:11.450
I THINK--

00:19:11.919 --> 00:19:13.352
( Stan )
WHOA!

00:19:13.354 --> 00:19:14.486
HOLY CRAP.

00:19:14.488 --> 00:19:17.656
THE MOUNTAIN,
ITS BLOWN ITS TOP!

00:19:21.195 --> 00:19:24.896
OH, MY GOD,
THEY KILLED KENNY!

00:19:25.132 --> 00:19:26.932
( mumbling )

00:19:29.103 --> 00:19:30.736
LOOK,
THE VOLCANO!

00:19:30.738 --> 00:19:33.071
WAIT,
DUCK AND COVER!

00:19:34.308 --> 00:19:35.807
( screaming )

00:19:35.809 --> 00:19:38.810
THAT LAVA'S COMING
RIGHT FOR US!

00:19:39.246 --> 00:19:41.646
OH, NO,
LOOK!

00:19:42.082 --> 00:19:45.017
WHAT THE HELL IS THIS
TRENCH DOING HERE?!

00:19:45.019 --> 00:19:46.385
WE CAN'T
GET ACROSS!

00:19:46.387 --> 00:19:48.453
IT NOW LOOKS AS IF
THE MISSING CHILDREN

00:19:48.455 --> 00:19:50.555
ARE TRAPPED IN THE PATH
OF HOT NASTY LAVA.

00:19:50.557 --> 00:19:54.359
GOD, PLEASE DELIVER THOSE
DARLING KIDS FROM--

00:19:54.361 --> 00:19:57.629
WAIT, WAIT, WAIT,
THREE, TWO, AND ONE.

00:19:57.631 --> 00:20:00.532
GOD, PLEASE DELIVER...

00:20:00.534 --> 00:20:02.067
HELP!

00:20:10.944 --> 00:20:11.510
JIMINY!

00:20:11.512 --> 00:20:13.178
IT'S THE<i> REAL</i>
SKUZZLE-BUTT!

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:15.147
WHAT?!
SKUZZLE-BUTT'S REAL?

00:20:15.149 --> 00:20:17.549
OH, MY GOD,
LOOK AT HIS LEG!

00:20:17.551 --> 00:20:20.619
HI KIDS, I'M TV's
PATRICK DUFFY.

00:20:20.854 --> 00:20:23.021
QUICK, NED,
SHOOT IT!

00:20:23.023 --> 00:20:26.658
OH, NO,
OUT OF AMMO.

00:20:27.561 --> 00:20:29.828
WHAT IS
THAT THING?

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.329
THAT'S SKUZZLE-BUTT.

00:20:31.331 --> 00:20:35.033
HE HAS PATRICK DUFFY FOR A LEG
AND WEAVES BASKETS.

00:20:35.035 --> 00:20:36.535
THIS ISN'T
HAPPENING.

00:20:36.537 --> 00:20:38.403
EVERYONE
LOOK AWAY PLEASE!

00:20:38.405 --> 00:20:40.272
NOTHING
TO SEE HERE.

00:20:40.274 --> 00:20:40.839
WELL BOYS,

00:20:40.841 --> 00:20:44.109
I'M SORRY I GOT YOU
ALL KILLED.

00:20:49.516 --> 00:20:50.649
AAH...!

00:20:51.618 --> 00:20:55.153
( Stan )
WHOA, HE BUILT
A WICKER BASKET.

00:20:55.155 --> 00:20:58.323
HEY,
HE'S SAVING US!

00:21:02.563 --> 00:21:04.830
SKUZZLE-BUTT
SAVED THE DAY.

00:21:04.832 --> 00:21:06.298
AND MY
CALCULATIONS WORKED.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:10.402
THE LAVA'S FOLLOWING
THE TRENCH INTO THE CANYON.

00:21:10.604 --> 00:21:14.005
WHERE EXACTLY
DOES THE CANYON GO?

00:21:14.007 --> 00:21:15.207
UH...

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.710
( crowd screaming )

00:21:19.780 --> 00:21:22.581
SOUTH PARK
IS SAVED!

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:24.883
( Stan )
HEY LOOK,
KENNY'S OKAY!

00:21:24.885 --> 00:21:29.454
AND NOW THESE HUMBLE PEOPLE
CAN REJOICE AND CELEBRATE

00:21:29.456 --> 00:21:31.857
THEIR JOVIAL VICTORY
OVER NATURE.

00:21:31.859 --> 00:21:34.626
I'M GETTING WORD THAT THE CHEF
OF THE SCHOOL CAFETERIA

00:21:34.628 --> 00:21:36.061
WANTS TO
SING A SONG

00:21:36.063 --> 00:21:38.563
ABOUT THIS THRILLING
STRUGGLE OF HUMANITY.

00:21:38.565 --> 00:21:42.534
♪ MMM BABY,
EVERY TIME THAT WE KISS ♪

00:21:42.536 --> 00:21:43.301
♪ HOT LAVA ♪

00:21:43.303 --> 00:21:46.338
♪ EVERY TIME WE MAKE LOVE
THERE'S LAVA ♪

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:47.272
♪ HOT LAVA ♪

00:21:47.274 --> 00:21:49.474
♪ LAVA SO HOT
IT MAKES ME SWEAT ♪

00:21:49.476 --> 00:21:52.043
♪ LAVA SO WARM
AND RED AND WET ♪

00:21:52.045 --> 00:21:52.577
♪ LAVA ♪

00:21:52.579 --> 00:21:55.981
WHAT DO YOU HAVE TO SAY
ABOUT THIS WONDERFUL OUTCOME?

00:21:55.983 --> 00:21:57.716
WE OWE EVERYTHING

00:21:57.718 --> 00:21:58.783
TO THIS FRIENDLY

00:21:58.785 --> 00:22:02.354
YET MISUNDERSTOOD
CREATURE.

00:22:02.756 --> 00:22:05.190
THANK YOU
SKUZZLE-BUTT.

00:22:05.192 --> 00:22:06.558
<i>FRIEND.</i>

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:09.394
OH, HOW SWEET.

00:22:11.064 --> 00:22:12.731
I DID IT,
I DID IT!

00:22:12.733 --> 00:22:14.199
I FINALLY
KILLED SOMETHING.

00:22:14.201 --> 00:22:15.934
OH, MY GOD,
WHAT HAS HE DONE?

00:22:15.936 --> 00:22:17.469
TURN OFF
THE CAMERAS!

00:22:17.471 --> 00:22:19.871
HEY,
THAT WAS EASY.

00:22:19.873 --> 00:22:21.139
NO!

00:22:21.141 --> 00:22:22.407
WHY GOD, WHY?!

00:22:22.409 --> 00:22:25.710
DAMNIT STAN, YOU SHOULDN'T
HAVE DONE THAT!

00:22:25.712 --> 00:22:26.144
WHY?

00:22:26.146 --> 00:22:27.512
MAKE UP
YOUR MIND.

00:22:27.514 --> 00:22:28.947
STAN, SOME THINGS
YOU KILL

00:22:28.949 --> 00:22:31.416
AND SOME THINGS
YOU DON'T, SEE?

00:22:31.418 --> 00:22:31.850
NO.

00:22:31.852 --> 00:22:34.352
ONLY NOW
IN THIS LATE HOUR

00:22:34.354 --> 00:22:36.555
DO I SEE
THE FOLLY OF GUNS.

00:22:36.557 --> 00:22:39.958
I'LL NEVER USE
A GUN AGAIN.

00:22:40.561 --> 00:22:42.527
( gun goes off )

00:22:44.264 --> 00:22:46.097
BUT I JUST WANTED YOU
TO BE PROUD OF ME

00:22:46.099 --> 00:22:47.966
LIKE YOU WERE
WITH KENNY.

00:22:47.968 --> 00:22:49.534
BUT KENNY'S
DEAD NOW STAN

00:22:49.536 --> 00:22:52.070
AND YOU'RE<i> ALWAYS</i>
GONNA BE MY NEPHEW.

00:22:52.072 --> 00:22:54.139
AND YOU JUST CAN'T
KILL<i> ANYTHING.</i>

00:22:54.141 --> 00:22:55.607
YOU UNDERSTAND?

00:22:55.609 --> 00:22:57.576
DUDE, I DON'T UNDERSTAND
HUNTING AT ALL.

00:22:57.578 --> 00:23:00.111
YEAH, IT'S STUPID,
LET'S GO WATCH CARTOONS.

00:23:00.113 --> 00:23:02.847
YEAH, CARTOONS
KICK ASS.
